Ocean rises with serpents and greets armed Rama --- Ocean pleads changeless nature but promises calm crossing --- Ocean names Nala Vishvakarman son to build supported bridge --- Nala claims Mandara boon and calls monkeys to build --- Hundred thousands fetch trees rocks and fill ocean --- Nala completes ten by hundred yojana bridge --- Gods marvel at inconceivable hair-raising bridge work --- Monkey crores cross shouting as Vibhishana guards rear --- Rama Lakshmana Sugriva lead host to fruitful shore --- Gods consecrate Rama and bless lasting victory
